          "modify_from": "Recover the highlighted identities from highlight_frame and order them red, green, blue, omitting unhighlighted colors; break same-color ties by increasing world x, then y.",
          "modify_to": "Recover the highlighted identities and their fixed order from highlight_frame: red, green, blue, omitting unhighlighted colors; within each color use increasing world y, then increasing world x for ties. Do not reorder using positions changed by handling. The carried count excludes the completed prefix of this fixed order."
        },
        {
          "modify_from": "A low grasp is not a completed lift. A still-held previously counted target must not increment it again.",
